  "origin": "Danish user queries from the DaKultur study, in which native Danish speakers wrote prompts to test the cultural awareness of Danish language models. Covers food, traditions, lifestyle, trivia, social norms, politics, language, arts, geography, transport, education, and work. Only the queries are included; model responses and human judgments from the original evaluation are not part of this release. 344 samples, 5.49K Llama-3 tokens. Published as arXiv:2504.02403 (Müller-Eberstein et al., 2025).",
